From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:13:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: G16: heap-allocate hang diagnostics

K15, preserving K4/K5: group wedge detection, render dump rings, slot-reuse history, stale tags and pressure/hold diagnostics in an always-allocated KBox<Diagnostics>. Initialize it in place and keep every diagnostic parameter, ring limit and update site. No cfg gate removes evidence from ordinary boots. The separate publish profiler stays static; notification and per-job timeline stamps already live in Arc/KVec allocations, so their format and availability stay unchanged.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16.rs         |  99 +++++++++++---------
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16_runtime.rs | 131 ++++++++++++++-------------
 2 files changed, 120 insertions(+), 110 deletions(-)

